      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 118,
      "end_line": 118,
      "raw": "수명 주기 후크 예:\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000064",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 119,
      "end_line": 119,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000065",
      "kind": "fenced_code",
      "start_line": 120,
      "end_line": 134,
      "raw": "```cpp\nlvrs::QmlBootstrapTask loadDomains;\nloadDomains.name = QStringLiteral(\"load-domains\");\nloadDomains.stage = lvrs::QmlAppLifecycleStage::AfterFirstIdle;\nloadDomains.run = [](const lvrs::QmlAppLifecycleContext &context, QString *errorMessage) {\n    lvrs::BootstrapParallelRunOptions options;\n    options.applyReceiver = context.application;\n\n    const lvrs::BootstrapParallelRunResult result =\n        lvrs::runBootstrapParallelTasks(buildDomainTasks(), options);\n    if (!result.ok && errorMessage)\n        *errorMessage = result.errorMessage();\n    return result.ok;\n};\n```\n",
      "language": "cpp",
